{"mls":"B1715924","addr":"307 The Heights","muni":"Little Valley town","town":"Little Valley","county":"Cattaraugus","zip":"14755","ll":[42.219031,-78.815611],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":4,"baths":2,"sqft":1970.0,"year":1949,"lot":4.33,"dom":19,"price":225000,"orig":235000,"chg":"Price Change","tax":4307,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"WNY Metro Roberts Realty","phone":"716-880-7022","hhp":false,"remarks":"Privacy, Space & Plenty of Potential!\r\n\r\nTucked away on a quiet dead-end street, this spacious 4-bedroom home sits on a tad over 4 acres, with woods both in front and behind you. If you've been looking for a home that offers privacy, space, character, and plenty of room to enjoy the outdoors, this one is worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you'll immediately appreciate the warm character and charm this home has to offer. Gorgeous hardwood floors throughout much of the house, beautiful woodwork, spacious rooms, and a gorgeous fireplace create an inviting atmosphere that feels like home. With nearly 2,000 square feet, there's plenty of space for everyone, along with huge closets for all your storage needs.\r\n\r\nThe home features 4 bedrooms, 2 full updated bathrooms, first-floor laundry, newer windows, a new furnace, and fresh paint, giving you a great combination of character and some important modern updates. The attached garage adds even more convenience.\r\n\r\nOutside is where this property really opens up. With over 4 acres and woods surrounding you, there's room to garden, entertain, explore, create trails, enjoy a fire pit, or simply sit back and enjoy the peace and privacy. It's the kind of property where you can truly spread out and make it your own.\r\n\r\nThe major pieces are already here, and with some additional updates and your personal touches, this could become an incredibly inviting and special home. If you're looking for a property with personality, privacy, and room to grow, don't overlook this one!"